<t id="1078" p="0.00 115.12" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Q: What is the product? Say what hazard you would warn a colleague about before running this. [5]</s></t>
<t id="1079" p="0.00 134.12" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Answer</s></t>
<t id="1080" p="0.00 242.10" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Hazard: HF, hydrofluoric, fluoride, calcium gluconate, burn, bone, necrosis</s></t>
